msgstr "Instalação do Kbd"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The behavior of the backspace and delete keys is not consistent across the "
"keymaps in the Kbd package. The following patch fixes this issue for i386 "
"keymaps:"
msgstr ""
"O comportamento das teclas backspace e delete não é consistente ao longo dos"
" mapas de teclas no pacote Kbd. O seguinte remendo corrige esse problema "
"para mapas de tecla i386:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:48
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../&kbd-backspace-patch;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">patch -Np1 -i ../&kbd-backspace-patch;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:50
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"After patching, the backspace key generates the character with code 127, and"
" the delete key generates a well-known escape sequence."
msgstr ""
"Após remendar, a tecla backspace gera o carácter com código 127 e a tecla "
"delete gera uma sequência de escape bem conhecida."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:53
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Remove the redundant <command>resizecons</command> program (it requires the "
"defunct svgalib to provide the video mode files - for normal use "
"<command>setfont</command> sizes the console appropriately) together with "
"its manpage."
msgstr ""
"Remova o aplicativo redundante <command>resizecons</command> (ele exige que "
"a defunta svgalib forneça os arquivos de modo de vídeo - para uso normal "
"<command>setfont</command> dimensiona o console adequadamente) juntamente "
"com a página de manual dele."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:58
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/RESIZECONS_PROGS=/s/yes/no/' configure\n"
"sed -i 's/resizecons.8 //' docs/man/man8/Makefile.in</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/RESIZECONS_PROGS=/s/yes/no/' configure\n"
"sed -i 's/resizecons.8 //' docs/man/man8/Makefile.in</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:61
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare Kbd for compilation:"
msgstr "Prepare Kbd para compilação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:63
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-"
"vlock</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr --disable-"
"vlock</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:66
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the configure option:"
msgstr "O significado da opção de configure:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:69
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--disable-vlock</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--disable-vlock</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:71
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This option prevents the vlock utility from being built because it requires "
"the PAM library, which isn't available in the chroot environment."
msgstr ""
"Essa opção evita que o utilitário vlock seja construído, pois ele exige a "
"biblioteca PAM, a qual não está disponível no ambiente chroot."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:79
#, xml-text
msgid "Compile the package:"
msgstr "Compile o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:81
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:83
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue:"
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:85
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"test\">make check</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"test\">make check</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:87
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:89
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"install\">make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:92
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For some languages (e.g., Belarusian) the Kbd package doesn't provide a "
"useful keymap where the stock <quote>by</quote> keymap assumes the "
"ISO-8859-5 encoding, and the CP1251 keymap is normally used. Users of such "
"languages have to download working keymaps separately."
msgstr ""
"Para alguns idiomas (por exemplo, Bielorrusso) o pacote Kbd não fornece um "
"mapa de tecla útil onde o mapa de tecla <quote>by</quote> regular supõe a "
"codificação ISO-8859-5 e o mapa de tecla CP1251 normalmente é usado. "
"Usuários(as) de tais idiomas tem que transferir mapas de tecla funcionais "
"separadamente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:98
#, xml-text
msgid "If desired, install the documentation:"
msgstr "Se desejado, instale a documentação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/kbd.xml:100
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">cp -R -v docs/doc -T /usr/share/doc/kbd-&kbd-"
"version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">cp -R -v docs/doc -T /usr/share/doc/kbd-&kbd-"
"version;</userinput>"

